    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:7f4560d932d33c16",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "de1b232f658f4befcf8aa3171c0040a09d22e122a3dc7d242d7a354a2a265002",
      "text": "In the morning, hike to the El Tigre waterfalls. The trail takes about 3 hours and ranges from moderate to challenging, with river crossings and rocky sections. Finish with a light snack by the river and about 35 minutes on horseback. In the afternoon, travel to La Fortuna at the northern foot of Arenal and relax in the hot springs. Overnight near Arenal.",
      "provenance": {
